00:49:09.834 --> 00:49:14.667
- Who sponsor for
the family to come.

00:49:14.667 --> 00:49:17.300
And I had a cousin,

00:49:17.300 --> 00:49:19.266
who she's still around,

00:49:19.266 --> 00:49:20.233
first cousin,

00:49:20.233 --> 00:49:25.133
my mother's
brother's daughter.

00:49:25.133 --> 00:49:27.300
Rita, and we were walking

00:49:30.400 --> 00:49:32.233
