00:49:32.233 --> 00:49:33.433
and at that time--

00:49:33.433 --> 00:49:34.300
- [Gary] Alexander's?

00:49:34.300 --> 00:49:35.667
- It was Alexander's.

00:49:35.667 --> 00:49:36.500
- [Gary] I know the story.

00:49:36.500 --> 00:49:39.233
- A store,
a big department store

00:49:39.233 --> 00:49:41.433
like Target today.

00:49:41.433 --> 00:49:43.600
It's called Alexander's
and I saw that--

00:49:43.600 --> 00:49:46.600
- Like a Macy's actually.
- [Sasha] Like Macy's, right.

00:49:46.600 --> 00:49:51.100
And I said, one day I'm going
to have something like that.

00:49:51.100 --> 00:49:54.133
And she looks at me and
she starts laughing, but--

00:49:54.133 --> 00:49:56.166
- Is that why you built
a three story wine shop?

00:49:56.166 --> 00:49:59.266
- [Sasha] Yeah, I guess
you're right. (both laughing)

00:49:59.266 --> 00:50:01.266
- We didn't necessarily
need that many floors.

00:50:01.266 --> 00:50:02.600
- [Sasha] Right.
- But you're like fuck it,

00:50:02.600 --> 00:50:03.567
I need to make
that dream happen.

00:50:03.567 --> 00:50:06.233
- [Sasha] That's right.
Yeah, that's...

00:50:07.567 --> 00:50:09.800
Listen, land of opportunities.

00:50:09.800 --> 00:50:12.734
If you want to
accomplish anything,

00:50:12.734 --> 00:50:15.066
there is not a
better place to live.

00:50:15.066 --> 00:50:17.700
And not a better place to be.

00:50:17.700 --> 00:50:19.467
- Just gotta put in the work.

00:50:19.467 --> 00:50:22.800
- I left from a country where
everything was suppressed.

00:50:22.800 --> 00:50:23.667
It's a...

00:50:25.934 --> 00:50:28.934
communist country.

00:50:28.934 --> 00:50:32.533
You know,
everybody should be equal.

00:50:32.533 --> 00:50:34.800
And, you know--
- It was fucked up.

00:50:34.800 --> 00:50:37.700
- Yeah. Yeah.
Didn't work.

00:50:37.700 --> 00:50:41.033
- I remember the
biggest things that impacted me

00:50:41.033 --> 00:50:42.667
was that you and
mom thought that if

00:50:42.667 --> 00:50:44.467
somebody was fifty or sixty,

00:50:44.467 --> 00:50:46.200
they were very
old because people

00:50:46.200 --> 00:50:49.667
