miserable under communism.

00:50:49.667 --> 00:50:50.500
People died!

00:50:50.500 --> 00:50:51.834
- Yeah. People were,

00:50:51.834 --> 00:50:56.467
you know, at sixty people
used to die because--

00:50:56.467 --> 00:50:58.533
- [Gary] They
were just miserable!

00:50:58.533 --> 00:51:00.867
This man back here's parents.

00:51:00.867 --> 00:51:01.333
Right?

00:51:01.333 --> 00:51:02.200
- [Other Tyler] Came
from Russia, yeah.

00:51:02.200 --> 00:51:03.300
- Yep.
- They came from Russia?

00:51:03.300 --> 00:51:04.967
- [Other Tyler] Ukraine.
- Ukraine.

00:51:04.967 --> 00:51:06.500
Not a good place to be today.

00:51:06.500 --> 00:51:08.033
- [Other Tyler] Yeah. Terrible.

00:51:08.033 --> 00:51:09.467
- Tough. You got something?

00:51:09.467 --> 00:51:10.633
- [Andy] J.R. in Dallas.

00:51:10.633 --> 00:51:11.667
