how's it going?

00:51:15.333 --> 00:51:16.734
- Wait, wait, wait!
- Wait a minute. J.R.?

00:51:16.734 --> 00:51:18.767
Your name is J.R.
and you're from Dallas?

00:51:18.767 --> 00:51:20.233
- He's from Dallas?

00:51:20.233 --> 00:51:21.333
- [J.R.] Yes sir.

00:51:21.333 --> 00:51:22.834
The one and only.
- You used to be a show right?

00:51:22.834 --> 00:51:26.200
- Yeah, you got
shot back in 1980.

00:51:26.200 --> 00:51:27.767
(J.R. laughs)

00:51:27.767 --> 00:51:28.834
- You still alive?

00:51:28.834 --> 00:51:30.734
- [J.R.] I came back to life.
I was born in '82.

00:51:30.734 --> 00:51:33.800
- Respect. My man, how are you?

00:51:33.800 --> 00:51:35.166
- [J.R.] I'm doing great.

00:51:35.166 --> 00:51:38.800
Thank you, Gary, very
much for the flip challenge.

00:51:38.800 --> 00:51:41.333
Made a little
bit of money on eBay.

00:51:41.333 --> 00:51:43.900
Also a little bit of
money on Facebook ads.

