So thank you very much
for that, first and foremost.

00:51:46.033 --> 00:51:46.633
- You're welcome.

00:51:46.633 --> 00:51:50.633
- [J.R.] Sasha, I had a
question mainly for you.

00:51:51.967 --> 00:51:53.834
I'm a young dad here.
- I hope I can answer.

00:51:53.834 --> 00:51:54.900
- Young dad.

00:51:54.900 --> 00:51:56.200
- [J.R.] I'm a young dad.

00:51:56.200 --> 00:51:57.000
- Oh.

00:51:58.734 --> 00:52:03.667
- [J.R.] I keep struggling with
the work-life balance thing.

00:52:03.667 --> 00:52:05.500
I know you guys
kinda don't really

00:52:05.500 --> 00:52:07.333
answer questions
