00:52:07.333 --> 00:52:08.667
You know, family.

00:52:08.667 --> 00:52:11.800
It's just different
for different people.

00:52:11.800 --> 00:52:15.867
How did you get through
those times when you were

00:52:15.867 --> 00:52:17.734
