while we both worked there

00:54:22.967 --> 00:54:25.033
who stole a shit-load of money.

00:54:25.033 --> 00:54:27.867
Not money--
- Dad, I think people steal--

00:54:27.867 --> 00:54:32.000
ninety percent of the
people here steal time all day.

00:54:32.000 --> 00:54:33.633
No, that's not what I mean.

00:54:33.633 --> 00:54:34.633
I don't mean that.

00:54:34.633 --> 00:54:37.467
People stole under
my watch every day.

00:54:37.467 --> 00:54:39.767
Let alone under
your watch every day.

00:54:39.767 --> 00:54:41.333
No, you were obsessed with it.

00:54:41.333 --> 00:54:44.000
Do you believe that was a

00:54:44.000 --> 00:54:47.033
byproduct of the Soviet system?

00:54:47.033 --> 00:54:48.967
- Yeah, it has a
lot to do with--

00:54:48.967 --> 00:54:50.166
- 'Cause that's what
I think in hindsight.

00:54:50.166 --> 00:54:54.900
- Where I came from,
and my upbringing.

00:54:54.900 --> 00:54:56.233
It definitely have
a lot to do with that.

00:54:56.233 --> 00:54:57.567
- So what are you telling J.R.?

00:54:57.567 --> 00:54:59.066
J.R., real quick.
- J.R., let me tell--

00:54:59.066 --> 00:54:59.900
Let me tell you
something real quick.

00:54:59.900 --> 00:55:00.734
I apologize, Dad.

00:55:00.734 --> 00:55:03.000
J.R., when
people hear my stories,

00:55:03.000 --> 00:55:04.233
I don't think
they really realize

00:55:04.233 --> 00:55:06.033
that we're an extreme family.

00:55:06.033 --> 00:55:08.567
Like, my dad came
to one baseball game.

00:55:08.567 --> 00:55:10.400
- We're not normal family.

00:55:10.400 --> 00:55:12.600
- My dad came to one
baseball game in my entire life.

00:55:12.600 --> 00:55:14.100
I can remember it vividly.

00:55:14.100 --> 00:55:15.166
It was an All-Star game.

00:55:15.166 --> 00:55:16.633
I pitched.
I was super pumped.

00:55:16.633 --> 00:55:19.700
He came with my, who
passed away, Uncle Misha.

00:55:19.700 --> 00:55:21.934
They both came.
I was super pumped.

00:55:21.934 --> 00:55:23.900
That is
literally the only event.

00:55:23.900 --> 00:55:24.667
- Let me
interrupt you for a second.

00:55:24.667 --> 00:55:27.700
- [Gary] Please.

00:55:27.700 --> 00:55:31.033
- The graduation
my daughter had--

00:55:31.033 --> 00:55:32.467
- [Gary] In high school?
- in high school.

00:55:32.467 --> 00:55:34.033
- [Gary] Okay.

00:55:34.033 --> 00:55:35.166
1997.

00:55:35.166 --> 00:55:40.266
- Is that when you used to call
